[ar: Billy Joel]
[al: The Stranger]
[ti: Just the Way You Are]
[length: 04:50]

[00:08.63]Don't go changing to try and please me
[00:15.45]You never let me down before
[00:22.67]Don't imagine you're too familiar
[00:29.47]And I don't see you anymore
[00:35.06]I would not leave you in times of trouble
[00:43.24]We never could have come this far
[00:47.28]
[00:50.01]I took the good times, I'll take the bad times
[00:57.06]I'll take you just the way you are
[01:03.44]
[01:07.76]Don't go trying some new fashion
[01:14.36]Don't change the color of your hair
[01:21.21]You always have my unspoken passion
[01:28.28]Although I might not seem to care
[01:33.64]I don't want clever conversation
[01:42.20]I never want to work that hard
[01:45.77]
[01:48.92]I just want someone that I can talk to
[01:55.78]I want you just the way you are
[02:01.84]
[02:06.29]I need to know that you will always be
[02:13.03]The same old someone that I knew
[02:18.47]Oh, what will it take till you believe in me
[02:27.02]The way that I believe in you?
[02:31.87]
[02:32.07]I said I love you and that's forever
[02:40.88]And this I promise from the heart
[02:44.42]
[02:47.80]I couldn't love you any better
[02:54.36]I love you just the way you are, right
[03:04.95]
[03:29.74]I don't want clever conversation
[03:39.59]I never want to work that hard
[03:43.14]
[03:46.55]I just want someone that I can talk to
[03:53.82]I want you just the way you are
